  {
    "RowOffset": 787866,
    "RowId": 10023,
    "Description": "Increases damage dealt by self and nearby party members by 10%.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>15s\nCan only be executed while singing the <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Wanderer's Minuet</span>."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 788066,
    "RowId": 10024,
    "Description": "Delivers magic damage over time to all enemies in a cone before you.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Potency: </span>1,000\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>5s\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Gauss Barrel Effect:</span> <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Heat Gauge</span> gradually increases by 10 while <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Flamethrower</span> is active. <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Heat Gauge</span> not affected when used outside battle.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect:</span> Fire damage over time, stacking up to 5 times\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Potency:</span> 500\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration:</span> 6s\nEffect ends upon using another action or moving (including facing a different direction)."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 788730,
    "RowId": 10025,
    "Description": "Restores target's HP.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Cure Potency:</span> 3,000\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect:</span> Grants <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Dualcast</span> when spell is cast with a cast time\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration:</span> 10s\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect:</span> Increases both <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Black Mana</span> and <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">White Mana</span> by 5 when used to restore HP of self or a party member while in combat"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 789178,
    "RowId": 10026,
    "Description": "Executes <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Draw</span> and <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Minor Arcana</span> in succession.\nExecute command again to use the arcanum drawn. Only one arcanum can be drawn at a time.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration:</span> 30s\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect:</span> Restores 1,000 MP\nWill not overwrite currently saved arcanum."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 789526,
    "RowId": 10027,
    "Description": "Draws either <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Lord of Crowns</span> or <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Lady of Crowns</span>.\nShares a recast timer with <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Lord of Crowns</span> and <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Lady of Crowns</span>."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 789746,
    "RowId": 10028,
    "Description": "Increases damage dealt by a party member or self by 20%.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration:</span> 15s\nShares a recast timer with <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Minor Arcana</span>.\n\n※This action cannot be assigned to a hotbar."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 789978,
    "RowId": 10029,
    "Description": "Reduces damage taken by a party member or self by 20%.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration:</span> 15s\nShares a recast timer with <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Minor Arcana</span>.\n\n※This action cannot be assigned to a hotbar."
  },
